[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-zenith-bank-insurance-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-156":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},156,"zenith-bank-insurance-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-156","Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee Program 2026 | Career Opportunity","\u003Cp>Application for Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Entry Level Program 2026 now open.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Zenith Bank Insurance is currently recruiting smart and goal-driven individuals to join its Corporate Marketing team.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Entry Level Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Zenith Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> ||| \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands on experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career growth\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly salary \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee Program Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Application for Zenith Bank Graduate Entry Level Program 2026 now open. Zenith Bank is currently recruiting smart and goal-driven individuals to join its  Insurance  team.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As one of Nigeria’s leading insurance companies, Zenith offers a professional environment where employees can grow, innovate, and contribute to business success.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The 2026 Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee Program provide a well-structured pathway that promotes all round professional development for career growth.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benin\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Warri\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Port Harcourt\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Abuja\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Opportunity to work with a leading insurance company\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career growth in sales and marketing\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on industry experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Performance-based career advancement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Recruitment Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Entry Level Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>B.A or \u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FB.Sc\">B.Sc\u003C\u002Fa> (minimum of Second Class Lower – 2:2)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Experience in sales and marketing\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Strong communication and interpersonal skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Analytical thinking and problem-solving ability\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must be organized, innovative, and result-driven\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Experience in insurance marketing is an added advantage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Recruitment Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Trainee\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Zenith Bank Insurance Graduate Entry Level Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Send your CV to:\u003C\u002Fstrong> \u003Ca href=\"mailto:career@zenithinsurance.com.ng\">career@zenithinsurance.com.ng\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Title in this format: Marketing – Preferred Location (e.g., Marketing – Abuja)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fzenithinsurance.com.ng\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fzenithinsurance.com.ng\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-20 10:27:25",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fzenith-bank-insurance-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity\u002F69e5f17de5d9a7.16329348_screenshot 2026-04-20 102018.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fzenith-bank-insurance-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity\u002F69e5f17de5d9a7.16329348_screenshot%202026-04-20%20102018.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":3